  "ingredients": [
    "1.5 cups raspberries, rinsed and drained",
    "0.5 cup white sugar",
    "1 cup blueberries, rinsed and drained",
    "1.5 cups granola",
    "2 cups full-fat plain Greek yogurt",
    "1 teaspoon vanilla extract",
    "1 teaspoon lemon zest",
    "0.5 cup white sugar"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather all ingredients.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/mChTXAk-t9pchK1cWb9xG_zwmFU=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-8395550-make-ahead-frozen-yogurt-parfaits-VAT-4x3-ingredients-6d70002c73314d9e9ba5fe046d6ee34a.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/8395550/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Combine raspberries and ½ cup white sugar in a bowl. Crush with a potato masher into a puree. Cover and let sit out for 1 hour.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/Xory6KxTHL3DQv3mMZzAUnRpVFM=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-8395550-make-ahead-frozen-yogurt-parfaits-VAT-4x3-step-01-93092edba2bb44908c1d643bfa94886b.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/8395550/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Pass berry puree through a fine mesh strainer to remove seeds. Add blueberries, stir, and keep in the refrigerator until needed.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/PtLns0Xu0XLjrxltdaVp6ipNFjQ=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-8395550-make-ahead-frozen-yogurt-parfaits-VAT-4x3-step-02-059333eb94f14b10b25793668630174b.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/8395550/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Whisk yogurt, vanilla, lemon zest, and sugar for frozen yogurt together in a bowl until sugar dissolves and the mixture is light and fluffy. Transfer into a piping bag and refrigerate until needed.",
      "section": null,
      "name": "To Build Parfaits:",
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/KKmnAAATpCtYkIvHlX8P8gJnYY8=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-8395550-make-ahead-frozen-yogurt-parfaits-VAT-4x3-step-03-d8466e07225546cca1669c5d00026fd7.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/8395550/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Add 2 tablespoons of granola into an 8-ounce jar, or similar vessel. Top with 2 tablespoons of the fruit mixture. Try to make sure some of the fruit sauce is touching the glass so you can see the layers when frozen. Top with 2 heaping tablespoons of the yogurt mixture.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/xqnSNcb11wPxnbCqfFCoBvcRWAk=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-8395550-make-ahead-frozen-yogurt-parfaits-VAT-4x3-step-04-d462c75f23f64cc897f0da8fab9d8adb.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/8395550/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Repeat twice more for a total of 3 layers. Top can be garnished with any remaining fruit and sauce.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/swxCqel79OGINvkLndm9Hd5CqOQ=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-8395550-make-ahead-frozen-yogurt-parfaits-VAT-4x3-step-05-ef6c379f6bae40848b6ea8c008eed83e.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/8395550/step_06.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Freeze until frozen solid, about 8 hours, or overnight.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/Dba2RFaxF7u5ZXeD17MT8KOtSwg=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-8395550-make-ahead-frozen-yogurt-parfaits-VAT-4x3-step-06-471c60cd4ef5472b831cc55e37ade8f8.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/8395550/step_07.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Serve and enjoy!",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/Gt9nX0iEw7SZYJ6hJLoM4kYWeuM=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-8395550-make-ahead-frozen-yogurt-parfaits-VAT-hero-4x3-24020331899c422db6b787b5ef0399fc.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/8395550/step_08.webp"
    }
  ],
